(7517526, 1200613, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Beetle:</b></div><hr/><i> Ugh. This is a beautiful shot full of adorable detail and beauty.<br/> <br/>And yet, major shoehorn!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>You know full well that while you might have broken one rule re centering, you totally adhered to the fact that diagonal lines work way better than horizontals or verticals, and let''s not forget the main one: "Fill the frame".<br/> <br/>Good thing I didn''t vote..... I would have started off very highly for the lovely photo, yet felt compelled to dock you for the shoehorn reasons (see above). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hehe, Beetle hit it on the head! This isn''t centering, this is filling the frame -- no broken rules here!<br/> <br/>That being said, I am sooooooooo jealous!! OMG, what an incredible opportunity. I would love to have a hawk in my backyard! Truly fantastic catch. What a wonderful expression!<br/> <br/>Even if it is a shoehorn. :P</td>', 'Originally posted by Beetle: Ugh. This is a beautiful shot full of adorable detail and beauty. And yet, major shoehorn!!!!!!!!!!!! You know full well that while you might have broken one rule re centering, you totally adhered to the fact that diagonal lines work way better than horizontals or verticals, and let''s not forget the main one: "Fill the frame". Good thing I didn''t vote..... I would have started off very highly for the lovely photo, yet felt compelled to dock you for the shoehorn reasons (see above).   Hehe, Beetle hit it on the head! This isn''t centering, this is filling the frame -- no broken rules here! That being said, I am sooooooooo jealous!! OMG, what an incredible opportunity. I would love to have a hawk in my backyard! Truly fantastic catch. What a wonderful expression! Even if it is a shoehorn. :P', '2017-06-07 11:26:21.000000', NULL, 0),
