(7517608, 1200581, 67258, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> hehe!! I love it! Even though I''m terribly jealous of your european squirrels. How can my boring squirrels even begin to compete with something that cute?! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The reds are really rare in England - they have been driven out by the imported American greys who carry a pox that the red squirrels have no immunity to.  Really sad.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: hehe!! I love it! Even though I''m terribly jealous of your european squirrels. How can my boring squirrels even begin to compete with something that cute?!   The reds are really rare in England - they have been driven out by the imported American greys who carry a pox that the red squirrels have no immunity to.  Really sad.', '2017-06-07 15:18:31.000000', NULL, 0),
